### Clawork API Test
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:18080
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/bot/api/v1

### Variables
@userId = user-001
### 手动设置 botId（创建 bot 后替换为实际 ID）
@botId = your-bot-id-here
@skillName = my-skill

### ============================================
### Health Check
### ============================================

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ============================================
### Bot CRUD Operations
### ============================================

### Create a new bot
# @name createBot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": "{{userId}}",
    "name": "my-test-bot",
    "config": {
        "model": "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
        "api_key": "your-api-key-here",
        "agents_md": "# Agent Config\nYou are a helpful assistant.",
        "soul_md": "# Soul Config\nBe friendly and professional.",
        "mcp_servers": [
            {
                "name": "filesystem",
                "command": "npx",
                "args": ["-y", "@anthropic/mcp-server-filesystem"],
                "env": {}
            }
        ]
    }
}

### Create a simple bot (minimal config)
# @name createSimpleBot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": "{{userId}}",
    "name": "simple-bot"
}

### Create a bot with MiniMax config
# @name createMiniMaxBot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": "{{userId}}",
    "name": "minimax-bot",
    "config": {
        "model": "MiniMax-M2.1",
        "api_key": "your-minimax-api-key-here",
        "base_url": "https://api.minimaxi.com/anthropic"
    }
}

### List bots by user ID
GET {{apiUrl}}/bots?user_id={{userId}}

### Get a specific bot by ID
GET {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}

### Update a bot
PUT {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "updated-bot-name",
    "config": {
        "model": "MiniMax-M2.1",
        "api_key": "your-api-key-here",
        "base_url": "https://api.minimaxi.com/anthropic"
    }
}

### Delete a bot
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}

### ============================================
### Bot Lifecycle Operations
### ============================================

### Start a bot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/start

### Get bot status
GET {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/status

### Get bot connection info
GET {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/connect

### Stop a bot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/stop

### Restart a bot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/restart

### ============================================
### Channels Management (IM integrations)
### ============================================

### Add Telegram channel
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "channel": "telegram",
    "token": "your-telegram-bot-token-here"
}

### Add Discord channel
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "channel": "discord",
    "token": "your-discord-bot-token-here"
}

### Add Slack channel
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "channel": "slack",
    "bot_token": "xoxb-your-bot-token",
    "app_token": "xapp-your-app-token"
}

### List channels
GET {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/channels

### Remove a channel
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/channels/telegram

### ============================================
### Skills Management
### ============================================

### List skills for a bot
GET {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/skills

### Update/Create a skill
PUT {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/skills/{{skillName}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "# My Custom Skill\n\nThis skill helps with specific tasks.\n\n## Usage\n\nUse this skill when the user asks about...\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Do this\n2. Do that"
}

### Delete a skill
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{botId}}/skills/{{skillName}}

### ============================================
### Bot WebChat Access (via proxy)
### ============================================

### Access bot webchat page (replace with actual bot id)
### After bot is started, visit this URL in browser:
### http://localhost:18080/proxy/{bot-id}/
### Or with subdomain (requires hosts/DNS config):
### http://{bot-id}.workany.loc:18080/

### Test proxy endpoint (health check of openclaw)
GET {{baseUrl}}/proxy/{{botId}}/

### ============================================
### Test Scenarios
### ============================================

### Scenario 1: Full bot lifecycle test
### Step 1: Create bot
# @name scenarioBot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": "scenario-user",
    "name": "lifecycle-test-bot"
}

### Step 2: Start the bot (use ID from step 1)
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{scenarioBot.response.body.data.id}}/start

### Step 3: Check status
GET {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{scenarioBot.response.body.data.id}}/status

### Step 4: Add a skill
PUT {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{scenarioBot.response.body.data.id}}/skills/greeting
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "# Greeting Skill\n\nRespond to greetings warmly."
}

### Step 5: Stop the bot
POST {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{scenarioBot.response.body.data.id}}/stop

### Step 6: Delete the bot
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/bots/{{scenarioBot.response.body.data.id}}
